WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.350
Out of control, huh?

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.720
Yes. When its Master dies, a Dragon is
unable to maintain its Communicator body.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:16.260
Its natural ferocity takes over,
and it become impossible to control.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.370
But we need Dragons.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.600
Obedient Dragons that behave as we wish them to.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.610
That's what Resonance is for...
the formula that allows we humans

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:30.470
and the Dragons to conduct Communication.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.970
Continue carrying out your secret investigation.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:43.080
Now then, what to do?

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.810
In my younger days, I lost

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:10.680
even the reason for this pain

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:16.420
Crouching over, making excuses

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.620
I must have...

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:27.330
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:34.940
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.810
I'll always be with you

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.310
see the sky in front of you

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:44.680
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.990
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:54.660
I sing out

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:03.330
May my voice reach you

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.420
She's out of control!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:31.250
Machina...

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.750
Watch out!

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:03.950
Is that?

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:11.190
Toa, are you all right?!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.570
Stop, Machina!

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.040
Machina!

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.790
Machina, what's come over you?

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.130
Gio... run!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.060
Run away!

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:41.270
What's going on, Machina?!

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:45.000
The Resonance is... coming undone.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.110
What?!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:51.940
Run... before I'm no longer myself...

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.750
What do you mean?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:04:01.820
No... I'm... not free, like you are...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.460
Machina...

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.450
I'm...

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.480
What's wrong, Howling Star?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.990
I-It feels like...

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.160
Machina!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.000
Raina, please, let me go!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.510
I can't go unless you order me to!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:56.300
Something happened on Mars, didn't it?

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.180
Just a moment, Sigelinde.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.150
It's no use trying to stop us.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:10.050
Stop you? Don't be silly.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.720
Raina?

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.930
Actualization readings detected at hatch #6.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.270
What?

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:26.400
It's Howling Star and Amadeus!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.510
They're accelerating away from Moon sector!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.440
Open up a com line!

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:34.380
They're both offline,
and refusing communications.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.570
Where do they think they're going?

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.180
What in the world happened on Mars?

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.890
Wait! Stop!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:51.050
This is trespassing!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.770
What is this?!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.740
I'll come right to the point.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:06.040
We'd like you to remove
Prince Asim as the officer in charge

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.710
of your nation's military.

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.380
What?

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:13.250
Your good son has been
playing with fire a little too much.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.790
Indeed, perhaps even enough
to burn all of humanity.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:20.790
Are you giving me, the ruler
of this kingdom, an order?!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.660
No, of course not. We are
requesting that you do so.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.900
For the sake of your nation,
as well. As things stand,

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.670
the entire world will
end up turning against you.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:40.000
It appears you understand me.
Much appreciated, Your Majesty.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.950
Machina, why?!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.080
She's out of control.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:56.430
Looks like you didn't know.
A Dragon who loses their Master

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.030
has their true nature revealed.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.430
What?

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:04.540
Beautiful, isn't it?
The human factor falls away,

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.640
and they go back to being a pure Dragon.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:09.870
Why, you! Don't tell me
that's why you killed Akira!

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:15.650
I can't stand seeing Dragons being
contaminated by humans, see?

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.020
Contaminated?!

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:21.650
Yes! The power of love between
you and the Album was wonderful.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:27.030
But it just means that
you've defiled the Dragon.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:32.300
And so, Album, I shall
release you from that curse.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.330
I am not bound by Jin!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:40.240
Is that a fact? It looks
to me like you are in pain.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:44.010
Thanks to the heart of that human, there.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:46.410
You should rid yourself of it!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:47.880
Garnet!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.970
Yes, Your Highness.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.070
Get her!

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.740
Machina!

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:47.360
Look!

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:54.040
- The Girouard Force.
- Over this way, too!

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:04.760
Let's go, Gio.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.310
Yeah.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.900
I'm fighting, too.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.630
You let us handle the fighting.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:17.770
- But...
- I told you, I'll protect you.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.110
Yeah, the two of us will protect you, Toa.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.010
Jin... Gio...

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:43.260
Akira... Machina...

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.320
Sit tight. We'll be right back for you.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:55.530
All of you, bow down at my feet!

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:13.120
All Agathions show stable,
with vitals within permissible limits,

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.330
and no brainstem core irregularities.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:19.800
Releasing safeties on all equipment.
All units ready for combat.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.960
Go!!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:42.050
- Not bad, are you?!
- How is this enjoyable?!

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:44.720
What are you trying to do,
inflicting so many casualties?!

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:49.180
I told you, didn't I?
I just love beautiful things, that's all!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:08.250
What's the matter?
Can't you do anything yourself?!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.840
You shut your mouth!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.730
Album, come to me!

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.430
Come out of that shell, and return to me!

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:26.800
I will accept you as you are!

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.370
You haven't seen the true Toa!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.100
Then should I just tell her I like her,

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.870
or I'm in love with her, like you did?

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.040
I like you, I like you, I like you...

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:41.410
I love you, I love you, I love you!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.580
You're full of it!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.990
You're the ones who are full of it!

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.990
Your Resonance has you running in circles,

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:52.990
with the illusion that you
are in love, or something!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.390
- You're wrong!
- Am I?

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:58.000
Then why do you cling to the Album?!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.490
Because I like Toa!
Because I'm in love with her!

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.900
Ha! Because she covered up
your loneliness for you?

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.910
Because she loved you?

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.840
You fell in love with her
because she said she loves you!

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:16.010
I can't believe you'd be so foolish!
You're messed up!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:19.250
Didn't you ever have anyone
tell you they loved you?!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.950
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.860
What could low-birth scum
like you know about me?!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.760
You poor man.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:33.000
There must have been someone
around you who took notice of you.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.660
Silence, you insolent pest!

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.640
Someone who said they loved me, you ask?

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.510
I don't need anyone like that!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:57.820
Why, you! Agathions, rip him apart!

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:01.790
Your Highness, you've taken too
much damage! Please, withdraw for now!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.190
Don't you lecture me!

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:11.540
Agathion Control Reconnection.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.500
That's better.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.670
How could he?

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:17.710
He shot at his own side.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:22.550
I'll do whatever I please to my things.
What business is it of yours?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:25.020
To hell with love between Dragons and humans!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:28.040
With coexisting! You miserable fools!

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:35.020
Get them!

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.790
Toa! What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.200
Akira...

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:35.710
What's the matter?! You're looking
sloppy there, Kamishina Jin!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.260
Die!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:52.130
- Machina!
- You don't know when to die!

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:46.720
Machina!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.970
Album, I'll bet your death
is going to be beautiful.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:05.140
If you won't be mine,

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.980
then away with you!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.150
Toa!!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.640
Begone!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.420
W-What is this?

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.800
What's wrong? Why are you running away?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.070
The fight is just getting started!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:05.570
Why won't you do as I say?!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.760
Synapse intrusion?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:15.240
What? Fear?! Are you telling
me the Agathions are afraid?!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:21.580
Gio! What's the matter?!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.450
I don't accept it!

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:30.390
The power of love between Dragon and human?!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.790
I absolutely do not accept it!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:04.250
I-It's beautiful...

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:21.710
Asim...

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.850
Toa!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:38.690
Gio, what are you... Damn it!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.360
Toa!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.020
What is that?!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.010
Picking up a high-energy reading centered around

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.870
the northwest section of the Tharsis plateau.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:26.080
The pattern is... Gio's?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.510
What?

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:32.080
It's spreading out quickly.
What tremendous energy!

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.280
A distress signal?!

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:35.950
Let's go!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.140
Howling Star! Raina-san!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:20:00.240
What happened to Akira and Machina?

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.210
Well...

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.810
Let's just take refuge out
of the atmosphere for now!

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.330
Gio...

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:55.030
That's the true power of a Dragon?

00:20:55.030 --> 00:21:00.600
If that's so, we may have
misunderstood things something terrible.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.970
Our being together is...

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.810
...why, exactly?

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.880
Mars is burned over?

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:14.320
Traversing space, destroying planets...

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:17.320
Is that the true power of those Dragons?

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:22.360
It's too risky to leave them on Earth.
They are not under man's power.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:25.160
It's too late now.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:29.900
The only thing that can
defeat a Dragon is a Dragon.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:50.650
You don't even think hard about the meaning

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:52.920
of the words you spit out

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:57.330
you just run away from the present

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.560
Still doing the same things over and over,

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:01.700
like nothing has happened

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:05.370
It makes no sense to run away again

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:14.240
In the end, you're immature,
still a child, complacent

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:23.690
Leave behind your old self already

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:28.130
The righteous fight starts within you

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:32.560
What would you do?
You're out of time, aren't you?

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:37.630
Try to remember how you're supposed to be

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:44.780
before it all falls apart

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:50.910
Fight or flight

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:58.390
Fight or flight

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:46.170
What are you drinking, Megumi?

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:49.810
Oh, Ryoko-san, this is all the rage nowadays.

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:51.040
The "Melons Diet."

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:52.880
Just where are you getting
your information from?

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:57.310
But in this magazine...
Ah! This is from this month last year!

00:23:57.310 --> 00:23:59.280
Wow, the year sure went by fast, huh?

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:02.390
Yep. They say time flies
like an arrow, doesn't it?

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:06.160
That's really discouraging, huh?
Well, pull yourself together.

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:09.680
Next time, a new development
and a change of mind!
